1.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a1]{6.1.09.a1}, @xref[t.6.2.5,]{6.2.5: IM43438 Seg. A l. 1}} Whatever the man in authority said, it was not pleasant. 
2.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a2]{6.1.09.a2}} Whatever the man in authority said, it was not right. 
3.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a3]{6.1.09.a3}, @xref[t.6.2.2,t622.h5]{6.2.2: MDP 27 216}, @xref[t.6.2.5,]{6.2.5: IM 43438 Seg. A l. 2}} When the authorities are wise, and the poor are loyal, 
4.	it is the effect of the blessing of @wSN{Aratta}. 
5.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a4]{6.1.09.a4}, @xref[t.6.1.22,]{6.1.22: l. 190}, @xref[t.6.2.3,]{6.2.3: UET 6/3 80 l. 18}} The mighty man is master of the earth. 
6.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a5]{6.1.09.a5}} It is from a man's mouth that strength comes. 
7.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a6]{6.1.09.a6}, @xref[t.6.2.3,t623.h65]{6.2.3: UET 6/3 462}} Strength cannot keep pace with intelligence. 
8.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a7]{6.1.09.a7}} The strength of my god completes my own. 
9.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.09,t.6.1.09.a8]{6.1.09.a8}, @xref[t.6.1.17,t.6.1.17.b3]{6.1.17.b3}, @xref[t.6.1.17,]{ll. 12-13}, 5.6.7: l. 28} Youthful vigour has left my loins, like a runaway donkey. 
10.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.17,t.6.1.17.b3]{6.1.17.b3}, @xref[t.6.1.17,]{l. 14}, @xref[t.6.1.19,t.6.1.19.a1]{6.1.19.a1}, @xref[t.6.1.19,]{l. 1}, 5.6.7: l. 29} My black mountain has sprouted white gypsum. 
11.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.17,t.6.1.17.b3]{6.1.17.b3}, @xref[t.6.1.17,]{l. 15}, @xref[t.6.1.19,t.6.1.19.a1]{6.1.19.a1}, @xref[t.6.1.19,]{ll. 2-3}, 5.6.7: l. 30} My mother sent to me a man from the forest, 
12.	who has given me paralysed hands. 
13.	@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.17,t.6.1.17.b3]{6.1.17.b3}, @xref[t.6.1.17,]{ll. 16-17}, @xref[t.6.1.19,t.6.1.19.a1]{6.1.19.a1}, @xref[t.6.1.19,]{ll. 4-5}, 5.6.7: l. 31} My mongoose, 
14.	which used to eat strong-smelling @varh[t6110.v1]{food } @vart[t6110.v2,]{@note{1 ms. has instead:} meat }, can no longer stretch its neck toward a jar of ghee. 
15.	@q{“The lap three (?) times, 
16.	the eye (?) seven times”} is what she says to the one about to breach her defences. 
17.	@q{“Let me fill your new storehouse with my old hay.”} 
18.	A man turned toward you. What did he seize? 
19.	Her girl friend answered her as follows. 
